
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>互動式科技作品展示館｜前端開發學習歷程</title>
<script>
try {
    document.documentElement.dataset.theme =
        localStorage.getItem("portfolio-theme") || "dark";
} catch(e) {
    document.documentElement.dataset.theme = "dark";
}
</script>
<style>
/* ===== 01. 日夜主題 ===== */
:root {
    --bg:#f1f5f9;
    --panel:#ffffff;
    --panel2:#e2e8f0;
    --text:#1e293b;
    --muted:#64748b;
    --border:#cbd5e1;
    --accent:#2563eb;
    --accent2:#7c3aed;
    --glow:rgba(37,99,235,.15);
    --shadow:rgba(15,23,42,.12);
}
html[data-theme="dark"] {
    --bg:#0f172a;
    --panel:#1e293b;
    --panel2:#273449;
    --text:#f1f5f9;
    --muted:#94a3b8;
    --border:#334155;
    --accent:#38bdf8;
    --accent2:#c084fc;
    --glow:rgba(56,189,248,.18);
    --shadow:rgba(0,0,0,.3);
}
* {box-sizing:border-box}
html {scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:95px}
body {
    margin:0;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    font-family:"Microsoft JhengHei",system-ui,sans-serif;
    transition:background .3s,color .3s;
}
button,input {font:inherit}
button {cursor:pointer}
button:disabled {cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.6}
a {color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
[hidden] {display:none!important}
:focus-visible {outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}
.container {width:min(1150px,94%);margin:auto}
.muted {color:var(--muted)}
.btn {
    display:inline-block;
    padding:11px 18px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:12px;
    background:var(--panel);
    color:var(--text);
    transition:.2s;
}
.btn:hover:not(:disabled) {border-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn.primary {
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,#2563eb,#7c3aed);
    color:#fff;
    border-color:transparent;
    font-weight:bold;
}
.panel {
    padding:25px;
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:20px;
    box-shadow:0 10px 30px var(--shadow);
}
.section-title {font-size:1.5rem;margin:45px 0 20px}
.action-row {display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px}
.progress {
    height:12px;
    background:var(--panel2);
    border-radius:20px;
    overflow:hidden;
    margin:15px 0;
}
.progress-bar {
    width:0;height:100%;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#38bdf8,#a855f7);
    transition:width .3s;
}

/* ===== 02. 導覽列 ===== */
.navbar {
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    z-index:100;
    background:var(--panel);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}
.nav-inner {
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:12px;
    padding:12px 0;
}
.brand {font-weight:900;color:var(--accent)}
.nav-actions {display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.nav-actions .btn {font-size:.85rem;padding:9px 12px}

/* ===== 03. 首頁 ===== */
.hero {padding:65px 0 25px;text-align:center}
.hero h1 {
    margin:0 0 15px;
    font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem);
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));
    background-clip:text;
    -webkit-background-clip:text;
    color:transparent;
    cursor:pointer;
    user-select:none;
}
.hero p {line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}
.hero-actions {display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:25px}

/* ===== 04. 盲盒 ===== */
.mystery {text-align:center}
.mystery-icon {font-size:4rem;animation:float 3s ease-in-out infinite}
.mystery-result {
    margin-top:20px;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:15px;
    background:var(--panel2);
}
@keyframes float {50%{transform:translateY(-10px)}}

/* ===== 05. 問答與闖關 ===== */
.game-head {
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:12px;
    font-weight:bold;
}
.question {font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.7;margin:20px 0}
.options {display:grid;gap:10px;margin:15px 0}
.option {
    width:100%;
    padding:14px;
    text-align:left;
    color:var(--text);
    background:var(--panel2);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:12px;
}
.option:hover:not(:disabled) {border-color:var(--accent)}
.option.correct {background:rgba(34,197,94,.15);border-color:#22c55e}
.option.wrong {background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);border-color:#ef4444}
.feedback {
    padding:15px;
    border-radius:12px;
    background:var(--panel2);
    margin-top:15px;
    line-height:1.7;
}
.stage-grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}
.stage-card {
    text-align:center;
    background:var(--panel2);
    padding:18px 10px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:14px;
}
.stage-card.active {border-color:var(--accent)}
.stage-card.done {border-color:#22c55e}
.stage-icon {font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:8px}
.stage-card small {display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
.game-box {
    background:var(--panel2);
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:15px;
    margin-top:20px;
}
.game-input {
    width:100%;
    padding:13px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:10px;
    background:var(--panel);
    color:var(--text);
}
.memory-grid {
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:10px;
    max-width:420px;
    margin:20px auto;
}
.memory-btn {
    aspect-ratio:1;
    border:2px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:15px;
    background:var(--panel);
    font-size:2rem;
    color:var(--text);
}
.memory-btn.flash {
    background:var(--accent);
    color:white;
    transform:scale(1.06);
}
.memory-btn:disabled {opacity:1}
.energy-grid {
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:12px;
    max-width:450px;
    margin:20px auto;
}
.energy-btn {
    aspect-ratio:1.4;
    border:2px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:15px;
    background:var(--panel);
    color:var(--text);
    font-size:1.8rem;
}
.energy-btn.active {background:rgba(34,197,94,.2);border-color:#22c55e}
.energy-btn.error {background:rgba(239,68,68,.2);border-color:#ef4444}

/* ===== 06. 探索成就 ===== */
.achievement {text-align:center}
.achievement h3 {font-size:1.5rem}

/* ===== 07. 搜尋與作品 ===== */
.search-area {max-width:700px;margin:20px auto 30px}
.search-area input {
    width:100%;
    padding:17px;
    border:2px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:15px;
    background:var(--panel);
    color:var(--text);
}
.search-info {
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
    padding:12px 4px;
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.9rem;
}
kbd {background:var(--panel2);padding:3px 7px;border-radius:5px}
.projects {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}
.project-card {
    position:relative;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:space-between;
    min-height:235px;
    height:100%;
    padding:24px;
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:20px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 25px var(--shadow);
    overflow:hidden;
    transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s;
}
.project-card::before {
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    pointer-events:none;
    background:radial-gradient(circle at var(--mx,50%) var(--my,50%),var(--glow),transparent 65%);
    opacity:0;
}
.project-card:hover::before {opacity:1}
.project-card:hover {border-color:var(--accent)}
.project-card>* {position:relative;z-index:1;pointer-events:none}
.card-top,.card-bottom {display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.card-icon {font-size:2rem}
.tag {font-size:.75rem;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--panel2);color:var(--accent)}
.card-title {font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.6;margin:22px 0 10px}
.card-file {color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem}
.card-bottom {border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:15px;margin-top:20px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:bold}

/* ===== 08. 開場、星光、彩蛋 ===== */
.intro {
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    z-index:9999;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:20px;
    padding:25px;
    background:#020617;
    color:#38bdf8;
    text-align:center;
}
.intro-progress {width:min(350px,90%);height:8px;background:#1e293b;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden}
.intro-progress div {height:100%;background:#38bdf8;animation:loading 2s linear forwards}
@keyframes loading {from{width:0}to{width:100%}}
.spark {
    position:fixed;
    z-index:2000;
    width:6px;height:6px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:#38bdf8;
    pointer-events:none;
    animation:sparkFade .6s forwards;
}
@keyframes sparkFade {to{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-18px) scale(0)}}
.confetti {
    position:fixed;
    top:-20px;
    z-index:3000;
    width:9px;height:15px;
    pointer-events:none;
    animation:fall 3s linear forwards;
}
@keyframes fall {to{transform:translateY(110vh) rotate(720deg);opacity:0}}
.toast {
    position:fixed;
    left:50%;
    bottom:25px;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    z-index:5000;
    max-width:90%;
    padding:15px 22px;
    border-radius:15px;
    background:#1e293b;
    color:white;
    box-shadow:0 10px 30px #0005;
    text-align:center;
}
footer {padding:45px 15px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}
@media(max-width:900px) {
    .projects {grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    .stage-grid {grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
}
@media(max-width:600px) {
    .projects {grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .nav-inner {flex-direction:column}
    .nav-actions {justify-content:center}
    .hero {padding-top:35px}
    .panel {padding:18px}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
    *,*::before,*::after {
        animation-duration:.01ms!important;
        transition-duration:.01ms!important;
    }
    .project-card {transform:none!important}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- 科技開場 -->
<div class="intro" id="intro">
    <h1>⚡ INTERACTIVE PORTFOLIO</h1>
    <p>科技實驗室啟動中...</p>
    <div class="intro-progress"><div></div></div>
    <button class="btn" id="skipIntro">跳過動畫</button>
</div>

<!-- 導覽列 -->
<nav class="navbar">
    <div class="container nav-inner">
        <a class="brand" href="#top">⚡ PORTFOLIO LAB</a>
        <div class="nav-actions">
            <a class="btn" href="#mystery">🎁 盲盒</a>
            <a class="btn" href="#quiz">🎮 問答</a>
            <a class="btn" href="#lab">🔐 闖關</a>
            <a class="btn" href="#works">💼 作品</a>
            <button class="btn" id="themeBtn">☀️ 淺色模式</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>

<main class="container" id="top">

    <!-- 首頁 -->
    <section class="hero">
        <h1 id="mainTitle">前端開發學習歷程</h1>
        <p>HTML, CSS, JavaScript & Responsive Web Design Portfolio</p>
        <p>歡迎來到互動式科技作品展示館！<br>抽盲盒、玩遊戲、解鎖實驗室，最後探索我的八個作品。</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#mystery" class="btn primary">🎁 開始探索</a>
            <a href="#quiz" class="btn">🎮 知識挑戰</a>
            <a href="#lab" class="btn">🔐 科技實驗室</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 01. 盲盒：最上面 -->
    <section id="mystery">
        <h2 class="section-title">🎁 隨機作品盲盒</h2>
        <div class="panel mystery">
            <div class="mystery-icon">🎁</div>
            <h3>不知道先看哪個作品？</h3>
            <p class="muted">讓系統隨機挑選，看看你抽中了什麼！</p>
            <button class="btn primary" id="drawBtn">✨ 開啟神祕盲盒</button>
            <div class="mystery-result" id="mysteryResult" hidden>
                <h3 id="mysteryTitle"></h3>
                <p id="mysteryFile" class="muted"></p>
                <a class="btn primary" id="mysteryLink" href="about-us.html">🚀 進入這個作品</a>
                <button class="btn" id="drawAgain">🔄 再抽一次</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 02. 前端知識挑戰 -->
    <section id="quiz">
        <h2 class="section-title">🎮 前端工程師知識挑戰</h2>
        <div class="panel">
            <div id="quizStart">
                <h3>你能成為前端工程師嗎？</h3>
                <p class="muted">30 題題庫，每局隨機抽 10 題，每題 10 分，限時 120 秒。</p>
                <button class="btn primary" id="startQuiz">🚀 開始挑戰</button>
            </div>
            <div id="quizGame" hidden>
                <div class="game-head">
                    <span id="quizNumber"></span>
                    <span id="quizScore"></span>
                    <span id="quizTimer"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="progress"><div class="progress-bar" id="quizBar"></div></div>
                <div class="question" id="questionText"></div>
                <div class="options" id="quizOptions"></div>
                <div class="feedback" id="quizFeedback" hidden></div>
                <div class="action-row">
                    <button class="btn primary" id="nextQuestion" hidden>下一題 →</button>
                    <button class="btn" id="quitQuiz">結束本局</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div id="quizEnd" hidden>
                <h2 id="finalTitle"></h2>
                <h3 id="finalScore"></h3>
                <p id="finalMessage"></p>
                <button class="btn primary" id="restartQuiz">🔄 再挑戰一次</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 03. 四合一科技實驗室 -->
    <section id="lab">
        <h2 class="section-title">🔐 科技實驗室｜四合一闖關</h2>
        <div class="panel">
            <p class="muted">完成四項任務，解鎖科技實驗室的最終成就！</p>

            <div class="stage-grid">
                <div class="stage-card" id="stageCard0">
                    <div class="stage-icon">🔐</div>
                    <strong>第一關</strong>
                    <div>密碼解謎</div>
                    <small id="stageStatus0">未開始</small>
                </div>
                <div class="stage-card" id="stageCard1">
                    <div class="stage-icon">🐛</div>
                    <strong>第二關</strong>
                    <div>BUG 修復</div>
                    <small id="stageStatus1">未解鎖</small>
                </div>
                <div class="stage-card" id="stageCard2">
                    <div class="stage-icon">🧠</div>
                    <strong>第三關</strong>
                    <div>記憶晶片</div>
                    <small id="stageStatus2">未解鎖</small>
                </div>
                <div class="stage-card" id="stageCard3">
                    <div class="stage-icon">⚡</div>
                    <strong>第四關</strong>
                    <div>能量核心</div>
                    <small id="stageStatus3">未解鎖</small>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="progress"><div class="progress-bar" id="labBar"></div></div>
            <p id="labProgress">已完成 0 / 4 關</p>

            <div class="game-box" id="labWelcome">
                <h3>🚀 科技實驗室等待啟動</h3>
                <p>準備好挑戰四個不同的遊戲了嗎？</p>
                <button class="btn primary" id="startLab">開始闖關</button>
            </div>

            <!-- 第一關 -->
            <div class="game-box" id="passwordStage" hidden>
                <h3>🔐 第一關：密碼解謎</h3>
                <p>根據提示找出四位數密碼，解鎖實驗室入口。</p>
                <p><strong>提示：</strong>密碼由四個數字組成。</p>
                <p>第一位是 2 + 1；第二位是 2 × 2；第三位是 9 - 4；第四位是 2³。</p>
                <form id="passwordForm">
                    <input class="game-input" id="passwordInput"
                           inputmode="numeric" maxlength="4"
                           placeholder="請輸入四位數密碼" required>
                    <div class="action-row">
                        <button class="btn primary" type="submit">確認密碼</button>
                    </div>
                </form>
                <div class="feedback" id="passwordFeedback" hidden></div>
            </div>

            <!-- 第二關 -->
            <div class="game-box" id="bugStage" hidden>
                <h3>🐛 第二關：修復程式 BUG</h3>
                <p>系統發現三段錯誤程式，請選出正確修復方式。</p>
                <p id="bugCount"></p>
                <pre id="bugCode" style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#020617;color:#67e8f9;padding:15px;border-radius:10px"></pre>
                <div class="options" id="bugOptions"></div>
                <div class="feedback" id="bugFeedback" hidden></div>
                <button class="btn primary" id="nextBug" hidden>下一個 BUG →</button>
            </div>

            <!-- 第三關 -->
            <div class="game-box" id="memoryStage" hidden>
                <h3>🧠 第三關：記憶晶片挑戰</h3>
                <p>觀察發亮的晶片順序，然後依照相同順序點擊。</p>
                <p id="memoryRound">準備開始</p>
                <p id="memoryStatus" aria-live="polite"></p>
                <div class="memory-grid" id="memoryGrid"></div>
                <button class="btn primary" id="startMemory">開始記憶挑戰</button>
            </div>

            <!-- 第四關 -->
            <div class="game-box" id="energyStage" hidden>
                <h3>⚡ 第四關：啟動能量核心</h3>
                <p>在 30 秒內依照數字 1 → 9 的順序啟動所有能量節點。</p>
                <div class="game-head">
                    <span id="energyCount">已啟動 0 / 9</span>
                    <span id="energyTimer">剩餘 30 秒</span>
                </div>
                <div class="energy-grid" id="energyGrid"></div>
                <p id="energyStatus" aria-live="polite"></p>
                <button class="btn primary" id="startEnergy">⚡ 啟動挑戰</button>
            </div>

            <!-- 通關 -->
            <div class="game-box achievement" id="labComplete" hidden>
                <div style="font-size:4rem">🏆</div>
                <h2>科技實驗室解鎖成功！</h2>
                <p>恭喜完成密碼解謎、BUG 修復、記憶晶片和能量核心四項挑戰！</p>
                <button class="btn primary" id="restartLab">🔄 重新闖關</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 04. 探索成就 -->
    <section id="achievements">
        <h2 class="section-title">🏆 作品探索成就</h2>
        <div class="panel achievement">
            <h3 id="achievementTitle">🔎 初階探索者</h3>
            <p class="muted">每進入一個不同作品，就會累積探索進度。</p>
            <div class="progress"><div class="progress-bar" id="exploreBar"></div></div>
            <p id="exploreText">已探索 0 / 8 個作品</p>
            <button class="btn" id="resetExplore">重新開始探索</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 05. 八張作品卡片：最下面 -->
    <section id="works">
        <h2 class="section-title">💼 我的正式作品展示</h2>
        <div class="search-area">
            <input id="searchInput" type="search" placeholder="🔍 搜尋作品名稱或檔名...">
            <div class="search-info">
                <span>目前顯示 <strong id="visibleCount">8</strong> / <span id="totalCount">8</span> 個作品</span>
                <span>按 <kbd>/</kbd> 搜尋，<kbd>Esc</kbd> 清除</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="projects" id="projectList">

            <article class="project-item">
                <a class="project-card" href="about-us.html">
                    <div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">🏢</span><span class="tag">Frontend</span></div>
                    <div><h3 class="card-title">智造科技｜公司介紹與關係企業</h3><p class="card-file">about-us.html</p></div>
                    <div class="card-bottom"><span>進入專案</span><span>→</span></div>
                </a>
            </article>

            <article class="project-item">
                <a class="project-card" href="Bio.html">
                    <div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">👤</span><span class="tag">Frontend</span></div>
                    <div><h3 class="card-title">Kesin Chen - 個人履歷與作品集</h3><p class="card-file">Bio.html</p></div>
                    <div class="card-bottom"><span>進入專案</span><span>→</span></div>
                </a>
